{% if candidates %}
<attendees>
{% for candidate in candidates %}
{{ candidate.name }}: {{ candidate.role }}
{% endfor %}
</attendees>
{% endif %}
<transcript>
{% for speaker in speakers %}
*{{ speaker.speaker_id }}* - {{ speaker.transcript }}

{% endfor %}
</transcript>

For every diarized speaker ID above, propose a name and role. Use the speaker ID itself as
the name if you can't tell who they are from the dialogue.
